<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MAY 12/13.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MAY 12/13.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Tuesday, May 13 on Monday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to</p>
<p>one.</p>
<p>		   13.05.97	  12.05.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.4768	    6.5104</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3749	    2.3450</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.6126	    4.5654</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.3615	    3.2551</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5244	    0.5201</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7860	    0.7765</p>
<p>    EKK	  0.2969	    0.2930</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.9771	    6.9348</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6952	    0.6950</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2763	    1.2700</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
